<title>USA: HealthTech Intl reports April revenues.</title>
<headline>HealthTech Intl reports April revenues.</headline>
<dateline>MESA, Ariz 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthTech International Inc said April 1997 revenues totalled $2.15 million, an increase of 452 percent over April 1996 gross revenues of approximately $390,000.</p>
<p>HealthTech International said it is currently projecting annual gross revenues in excess of $25 million on a forward basis.</p>
</text>
